{"logId": "5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 89, 192, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 89.0], [192.0, 89.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "防溺水安全知识", "block_bbox": [150, 174, 313, 203], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[150.0, 174.0], [313.0, 174.0], [313.0, 203.0], [150.0, 203.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（一）游泳安全要点", "block_bbox": [154, 212, 317, 235], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[154.0, 212.0], [317.0, 212.0], [317.0, 235.0], [154.0, 235.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、下水时切勿太饿、太饱。饭后一小时才能下水，以免抽筋；", "block_bbox": [148, 243, 635, 267], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[148.0, 243.0], [635.0, 243.0], [635.0, 267.0], [148.0, 267.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、下水前试试水温，若水太冷，就不要下水；", "block_bbox": [147, 276, 514, 299], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 276.0], [514.0, 276.0], [514.0, 299.0], [147.0, 299.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、若在江、河、湖、海游泳，则必须有伴相陪，不可单独游泳；", "block_bbox": [147, 306, 653, 331], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 306.0], [653.0, 306.0], [653.0, 331.0], [147.0, 331.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、下水前观察游泳处的环境：", "block_bbox": [148, 339, 390, 362], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[148.0, 339.0], [390.0, 339.0], [390.0, 362.0], [148.0, 362.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、不要在地理环境不清楚的峡谷游泳；", "block_bbox": [148, 369, 460, 393], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[148.0, 369.0], [460.0, 369.0], [460.0, 393.0], [148.0, 393.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、跳水前一定要确保此处水深至少有3米，并且水下没有杂草、岩石或其他障碍物。以脚先入水较为安全；", "block_bbox": [147, 401, 642, 457], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 401.0], [642.0, 401.0], [642.0, 457.0], [147.0, 457.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、在海中游泳，要在海岸做一标记，沿着海岸线平行方向而游，不要涉水至深处。", "block_bbox": [147, 464, 652, 521], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 464.0], [652.0, 464.0], [652.0, 521.0], [147.0, 521.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [668, 229, 1077, 487], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[668.0, 229.0], [1077.0, 229.0], [1077.0, 487.0], [668.0, 487.0]]}, {"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 594, 1122, 641], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 709, 192, 742], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 709.0], [192.0, 709.0], [192.0, 742.0], [121.0, 742.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "防溺水安全知识", "block_bbox": [148, 789, 313, 818], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[148.0, 789.0], [313.0, 789.0], [313.0, 818.0], [148.0, 818.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（二）如何预防游泳时下肢抽筋：", "block_bbox": [149, 828, 420, 855], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[149.0, 828.0], [420.0, 828.0], [420.0, 855.0], [149.0, 855.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、游泳前一定要做好暖身运动。", "block_bbox": [149, 864, 432, 890], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[149.0, 864.0], [432.0, 864.0], [432.0, 890.0], [149.0, 890.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、游泳前应考虑身体状况，如果太饱、太饿或过度疲劳时，不要游泳。", "block_bbox": [147, 899, 682, 960], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[147.0, 899.0], [682.0, 899.0], [682.0, 960.0], [147.0, 960.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、游泳前先在四肢擦些水，然后再跳入水中。不要立刻跳入水中。", "block_bbox": [148, 970, 671, 1032], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[148.0, 970.0], [671.0, 970.0], [671.0, 1032.0], [148.0, 1032.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、游泳时如胸痛，可用力压胸口，等到稍好时再上岸。", "block_bbox": [149, 1041, 639, 1069], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[149.0, 1041.0], [639.0, 1041.0], [639.0, 1069.0], [149.0, 1069.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、腹部疼痛时应上岸，最好喝一些热的饮料或热汤，以保持身体温暖。", "block_bbox": [146, 1076, 663, 1139], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[146.0, 1076.0], [663.0, 1076.0], [663.0, 1139.0], [146.0, 1139.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [728, 842, 1092, 1139], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[728.0, 842.0], [1092.0, 842.0], [1092.0, 1139.0], [728.0, 1139.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1211, 1122, 1256], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [939.0, 1256.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "para