, "coordinate": [668, 229, 1077, 487], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[668.0, 229.0], [1077.0, 229.0], [1077.0, 487.0], [668.0, 487.0]]}, {"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.47341880202293396, "coordinate": [939, 594, 1122, 641], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.43605008721351624, "coordinate": [121, 709, 192, 742], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 709.0], [192.0, 709.0], [192.0, 742.0], [121.0, 742.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8517414331436157, "coordinate": [148, 789, 313, 818], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[148.0, 789.0], [313.0, 789.0], [313.0, 818.0], [148.0, 818.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5643399953842163, "coordinate": [149, 828, 420, 855], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[149.0, 828.0], [420.0, 828.0], [420.0, 855.0], [149.0, 855.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8294966220855713, "coordinate": [149, 864, 432, 890], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[149.0, 864.0], [432.0, 864.0], [432.0, 890.0], [149.0, 890.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9074375033378601, "coordinate": [147, 899, 682, 960], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[147.0, 899.0], [682.0, 899.0], [682.0, 960.0], [147.0, 960.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.911612868309021, "coordinate": [148, 970, 671, 1032], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[148.0, 970.0], [671.0, 970.0], [671.0, 1032.0], [148.0, 1032.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8610731959342957, "coordinate": [149, 1041, 639, 1069], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[149.0, 1041.0], [639.0, 1041.0], [639.0, 1069.0], [149.0, 1069.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9229700565338135, "coordinate": [146, 1076, 663, 1139], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[146.0, 1076.0], [663.0, 1076.0], [663.0, 1139.0], [146.0, 1139.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9365973472595215, "coordinate": [728, 842, 1092, 1139], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[728.0, 842.0], [1092.0, 842.0], [1092.0, 1139.0], [728.0, 1139.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.6627680063247681, "coordinate": [939, 1211, 1122, 1256], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1211.0], [1122.0, 1256.0], [939.0, 1256.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## DÍ\n\n## 防溺水安全知识\n\n## （一） 游泳安全要点\n\n1、下水时切勿太饿、太饱。饭后一小时才能下水，以免抽筋；\n\n2、下水前试试水温，若水太冷，就不要下水；\n\n3、若在江、河、湖、海游泳，则必须有伴相陪，不可单独游泳；\n\n4、下水前观察游泳处的环境：\n\n5、不要在地理环境不清楚的峡谷游泳；\n\n6、跳水前一定要确保此处水深至少有3米，并且水下没有杂草、岩石或其他障碍物。以脚先入水较为安全；\n\n7、在海中游泳，要在海岸做一标记，沿着海岸线平行方向而游，不要涉水至深处。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_668_229_1077_487.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"34%\" /></div>\n\n\n## DL\n\n## 防溺水安全知识\n\n## （二） 如何预防游泳时下肢抽筋：\n\n1、游泳前一定要做好暖身运动。\n\n2、游泳前应考虑身体状况，如果太饱、太饿或过度疲劳时，不要游泳。\n\n3、游泳前先在四肢擦些水，然后再跳入水中。不要立刻跳入水中。\n\n4、游泳时如胸痛，可用力压胸口，等到稍好时再上岸。\n\n5、腹部疼痛时应上岸，最好喝一些热的饮料或热汤，以保持身体温暖。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_728_842_1092_1139.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"30%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_668_229_1077_487.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_668_229_1077_487.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A10Z%2F-1%2F%2Fca8703d95744b394cf68fcae98a9c3b81177390e9be1a67d46d98a3570da2f31", "imgs/img_in_header_image_box_939_594_1122_641.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_939_594_1122_641.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A10Z%2F-1%2F%2Fda12115caff3ed2fb72e0a327974123197c5654be4b3843adc80473b148a3944", "imgs/img_in_image_box_728_842_1092_1139.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_728_842_1092_1139.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A10Z%2F-1%2F%2F0515b999e528da092a70fc80198194aa1d75d30be28205863946af33bd39f0eb", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1211_1122_1256.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1211_1122_1256.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A10Z%2F-1%2F%2F052cc2241840026799a3500fa22a23943e463eac42ecaf8af34569a37f41d42b"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F8c27a708506d102695e764b8e04def639c323dcdfe44e994f6e3e4a16501851a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F39a60ae5f95dd399c70f09f23983bdf3e5821aabaa1ea6efe69a599fdad289d0"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//5f8a5be3-c718-4e80-ae00-e9e07ef0d3fa/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A54%3A11Z%2F-1%2F%2F17ac2e4909255bcc4b292838049351636a9181280fee2bdf5cd67776e13e9095"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
